# Frontend served same-origin by the Thor server in production, so no API URL needed.
# In dev (npm start), the CRA proxy in package.json forwards /api, /auth, /health
# to http://localhost:3001 — also no env var needed.
#
# If you need to override (e.g. backend on a non-default port), uncomment:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
